{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"2499860","name":"勇者斗恶龙 VII Reimagined","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“大海另一头有更辽阔的世界……就由我们来证明！”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >故事从住在孤岛上的一群少年少女，怀抱着一缕微小的好奇心开始。一场横越大海、跨越时空的壮阔冒险，就此揭开帷幕。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在保留原作魅力的同时，重新构筑（Reimagined）系统与剧情，打造更易于上手的游玩体验。与以“人偶风”全新呈现的魅力伙伴们，一同启程踏上壮阔的冒险之旅！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/6b852c1df11261dd5a6ae3fba17d654e.poster.avif?t=1785474787\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/6b852c1df11261dd5a6ae3fba17d654e.webm?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/6b852c1df11261dd5a6ae3fba17d654e.mp4?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■故事</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >住在孤岛“艾斯塔德岛”的主角，有一天与挚友──基法王子一起发现了神奇石板的碎片。当他们将搜集来的碎片嵌进岛上神殿的底座后，便受到神秘光芒的引导，来到了一个陌生之地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每当发现一块石板，少年们的世界就会进一步拓展。然而，这场源自微小好奇心的冒险，最终将揭露诡异入侵的邪恶势力，以及世界隐藏的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/bc53d73288fbf12b642fbdf9164eb3c2.poster.avif?t=1785474787\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/bc53d73288fbf12b642fbdf9164eb3c2.webm?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/bc53d73288fbf12b642fbdf9164eb3c2.mp4?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■搜集石板碎片，开拓冒险舞台！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >推动故事发展的关键，是散落在各地的“石板碎片”。只要在城镇、迷宫等各种地点找到石板，世界就会不断扩展。与神秘神殿里的石板向导对话，或通过寻找“石板清单”和迷你地图上的提示来获得碎片吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从底座传送而至的地点中，将会展开各式各样的事件。其中还新增了随玩家选择而改变的剧情，以及全新的故事内容。<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■“人偶风”的角色们为故事增添魅力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >由鳥山明打造的角色设计，通过具有人偶般温暖质感的3DCG美术风格“人偶风”重新诠释。不仅是角色，原野与迷宫所呈现的尤如微缩模型般的风格也不容错过！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/f6d25a344f4b4a02e66f086efbaa0c22.poster.avif?t=1785474787\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/f6d25a344f4b4a02e66f086efbaa0c22.webm?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/f6d25a344f4b4a02e66f086efbaa0c22.mp4?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■全新职业系统</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作战斗的核心在于职业系统。每种职业都拥有专属的“职业特性”，只要在战斗中进入潜能爆发蓄力状态，即可发动“职业特性”。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >此外，随着冒险推进，还能解锁“兼任”不同职业，让角色能同时拥有两种职业。更能使用两种职业的咒文、特技和职业特性，队伍的战力将大幅提升！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/a54e2f254459017131493ffa8f159201.poster.avif?t=1785474787\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/a54e2f254459017131493ffa8f159201.webm?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/extras/a54e2f254459017131493ffa8f159201.mp4?t=1785474787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■有助于冒险的功能丰富多样！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >冒险中常用的一齐恢复等操作可设置为“快捷指令”，只需按下特定的按键即可轻松执行。此外还新增了“自动战斗”功能，以及能在原野上直接击败比自己弱的怪物的“原野攻击”等等，让探索节奏更流畅。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/e127acb741d302886fb63dd16df6d430abb5863e/header_schinese.jpg?t=1785474787","website":"","developers":["Square Enix","HEXADRIVE Inc."],"publishers":["Square Enix"],"release_date":"2026 年 2 月 5 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"59.99","final":"59.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 韩语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","Steam 集换式卡牌","可选颜色","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","可以仅用键盘","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","无需应对快速反应事件","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200/Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460/Intel® Arc™ A380/NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 15 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> *16GB RAM required with Intel® Arc™ GPU.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200/Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 580/Intel® Arc™ A750/NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 15 GB 可用空间</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/61ecb8567de5ab0392bd229ffad5dec14eb29279/ss_61ecb8567de5ab0392bd229ffad5dec14eb29279.600x338.jpg?t=1785474787","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/61ecb8567de5ab0392bd229ffad5dec14eb29279/ss_61ecb8567de5ab0392bd229ffad5dec14eb29279.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785474787"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/c03aa2077121ddeddfc38e0aae8b09fc605ca27d/ss_c03aa2077121ddeddfc38e0aae8b09fc605ca27d.600x338.jpg?t=1785474787","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/c03aa2077121ddeddfc38e0aae8b09fc605ca27d/ss_c03aa2077121ddeddfc38e0aae8b09fc605ca27d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785474787"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/1453eed0368d6cdbcc40032bfe466bbf19b18114/ss_1453eed0368d6cdbcc40032bfe466bbf19b18114.600x338.jpg?t=1785474787","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499860/1453eed0368d6cdbcc40032bfe466bbf19b18114/ss_1453eed0368d6cdbcc40032bfe466bbf19b18114.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785474787"}]}